 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Day parts (`2d4h`) in `parse`.
+- `format(ms, { days: true })` renders 24 hours or more as days (`1d 2h`).
+  Without the option the output is unchanged (`25h`).
+
 ## [1.4.0] - 2026-06-02
 
 ### Added
diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
